    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῠρά̆κ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
